<title>USA: Greater New York to form holding company.</title>
<headline>Greater New York to form holding company.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greater New York Savings Bank said it plans to adopt a new corporate structure by forming a holding company to be called Greater New York Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>The bank expects more financial and operating flexibility to stem from this.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
